#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0513 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable ending in SDTF must have a label that ends with "Imputation Flag" (or "Imput. Flag") and contains "Start" and "Date"
#note "ASDTF has no Imputation-Flag suffix; BSDTF lacks "Start"; CSDTF lacks "Date"; DSDTF carries the phrase but not at the END; ESDTF differs only in CASE. TR1SDTF, TRTSDTF, TR01SDTF and TR99SDTF all carry the SAME label, and only the library tells them apart: TRTSDTF is the ADSL literal TRTSDTF and TR01SDTF / TR99SDTF match the ADSL template TRxxSDTF (D9, PLAN-library-template-label-resolution), so var_name(\"LIBRARY\") is not *SDTF and the rule does not judge them; the near-miss TR1SDTF (one digit) matches no template, falls to the *SDTF stem and still fires."
#expectViolationCount 6
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Start Date Flag" variable_name=ASDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Analysis Date Imput. Flag" variable_name=BSDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Analysis Start Imput. Flag" variable_name=CSDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Start Date Imputation Flag Extra" variable_name=DSDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Analysis Start Date imputation Flag" variable_name=ESDTF
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Date of First Exposure Imput. Flag" variable_name=TR1SDTF
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *SDTF name=*SDTF label="{Start Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *DTF name=*DTF label="{Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRTSDTF name=TRTSDTF label="Date of First Exposure Imput. Flag"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRxxSDTF name=TRxxSDTF label="Date 1st Exposure Period xx Imput. Flag"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ASDTF type=Char label="Start Date Flag"
col BSDTF type=Char label="Analysis Date Imput. Flag"
col CSDTF type=Char label="Analysis Start Imput. Flag"
col DSDTF type=Char label="Start Date Imputation Flag Extra"
col ESDTF type=Char label="Analysis Start Date imputation Flag"
col TR1SDTF type=Char label="Date of First Exposure Imput. Flag"
col TRTSDTF type=Char label="Date of First Exposure Imput. Flag"
col TR01SDTF type=Char label="Date of First Exposure Imput. Flag"
col TR99SDTF type=Char label="Date of First Exposure Imput. Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x | x | x | x | x | x | x
---
